			"date": "2025-11-13T16:46:05.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> it’s not confusing, just a decanted way to see a very layered process, so takes time to unpack—and sadly, time is not what people dedicate to one single social media post 😅</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "115543448898192834",
			"parentId": "115543392059271166",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/115543448898192834",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
